Struggling with wrong colors on your ESP32 Cheap Yellow Display (CYD) with ST7789 and TFT_eSPI? Red showing as Blue? Black showing as White? This video shows exactly why it happens and how to fix it in 3 simple settings.
The Fix:

tft.invertDisplay(false) — fixes inverted colors
tft.pushColors(bitmap, w * h, false) — prevents double byte swap
TJpgDec.setSwapBytes(true) — single swap in the right place
-D TFT_RGB_ORDER=TFT_BGR in platformio.ini — fixes Red/Blue channel swap